@baseUrl = http://localhost:5287

# GET {{CampusGate.Api_HostAddress}}/weatherforecast/
# Accept: application/json

###
### 1. List courses → 200, 3 items
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/courses
Accept: application/json

### 2. Known course → 200
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/courses/CS101

### 3. Unknown course → 404
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/courses/XX999

### 4. Malformed code → 404 today (should be 400 — fixed in L02)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/courses/not-a-code!

### 5. OpenAPI document
GET {{baseUrl}}/openapi/v1.json

